                                                "sense_id": "68a70d36-34f9-39ef-974d-afefe0461e15",
                                                "text": "Emperor Ling went in state to the Hall of Virtue. As he drew near the throne, a rushing whirlwind arose in the corner of the hall and, lo! from the roof beams floated down a monstrous black serpent that coiled itself up on the very seat of majesty. The Emperor fell in a swoon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caaaeb0d-fbed-4eee-abc8-f31415270489",
                                                "sense_id": "68a70d36-34f9-39ef-974d-afefe0461e15",
                                                "text": "\"Tambi will be here in...\" He computed carefully. \"... in exactly twenty seconds.\" And, lo, Tambi appeared at that very moment."
                                            }
                                        ]
